  "iPhone／iPad：使用 Safari 打开回序，点击底部“分享”，再选择“添加到主屏幕”。其他浏览器可以在菜单中选择“安装应用”或“添加到主屏幕”。": "iPhone/iPad: Open Huixu in Safari, tap Share at the bottom, then choose Add to Home Screen. In other browsers, choose Install App or Add to Home Screen from the menu.",
