  "也谢谢你提出的每一个问题。你的每一次使用、每一条建议，都在帮助回序一点点成长。": "And thank you for every question you’ve raised. Each time you use Huixu and every suggestion you share helps it grow, little by little.",
  "回序目前仍然保持免费试用。如果它对你有所帮助，也欢迎通过爱发电自愿支持开发者。这份支持，会让我有更多时间继续把它做好。": "Huixu is still free to try. If it has helped you, you’re also welcome to support the developer with an optional tip on Afdian. Your support gives me more time to keep improving it.",
  "关于打赏": "About tips",
  "打赏只是支持，不会解锁功能，也不是购买服务。我无法承诺具体的更新内容或更新时间，但会在自己的时间和能力范围内，认真维护和持续更新回序。": "Tips are simply a way to show support. They don’t unlock features or purchase a service. I can’t promise specific updates or release dates, but I’ll continue to maintain and update Huixu with care, within the time and capacity I have.",
  "希望它能一直陪伴你，也陪伴更多正在探索自己的人。": "I hope it can continue to be there for you, and for more people learning what works for them.",
